{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1000_p", "source_sha256": "af04a7ce9874c08ecabf4d86bafc2e6b4416da88818a7e2f6bf109c6069c13ea", "ja": "（最近、少し仕事が立て込んでしまっている。たまには\n息抜きでもしなきゃ……ん？　あそこにいるのは……）", "zh": "（最近工作有点忙不过来。偶尔也得放松一下……嗯？在那里的是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "55204c9a94abe2182e1ebf418366c788c4072b890431e0e7fbc9ebd4d82b8212", "ja": "{$P$}、お待ちしておりました。\n今、少々お時間をいただいても良いでしょうか。", "zh": "{$P$}，让您久等了。\n现在可以占用您一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1002_p", "source_sha256": "41e431b158387abc7f8c5e145ef9da52ed24dec3f19ca81cbeef907996d10b13", "ja": "あれ、貴音？\n今日はたしかレッスンの無い日だったよな。", "zh": "哎，贵音？\n我记得今天明明没有课程安排啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "4bd26a641508b42342d1c1b77ca4a292361f9f77f2d722829747bca62e60ad43", "ja": "はい。先ほどまで、自宅で休んでおりましたが……\nふと今宵は満月であることを思い出しました。", "zh": "是的。刚才我一直在家中休息……忽然想起今晚是满月。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "5074d35316d5662008ff1c0ae236ec5203cd12cba0f34533f803f4148e5d73f5", "ja": "{$P$}、お迎えにあがりました。", "zh": "{$P$}，我来接您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f5a5825ddfe137268805c55f124656ab19f205047e5a23f3af6567233352744c", "ja": "……えっ？　満月だから？", "zh": "……诶？因为是满月吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "8b27c7bcbe19ad5139fea4c51ecfbf7c89c7af82f74d1496cbf58edf772c0b20", "ja": "ええ。美しい月夜ならば、気分転換になるかと。\n共に、風情ある場所へ赴きたいと思いまして。", "zh": "是的。想着在这美丽的月夜里，或许能转换一下心情。\n所以想和您一同前往一个富有情趣的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "e820a4eecd3b07c5942c5d7243791f2fed2e2d60401defe99651fe1cacb0a38a", "ja": "事前に連絡もせず、申し訳ありません。\nよろしければ仕事の後に……いかがでしょうか？", "zh": "没提前联系您，实在抱歉。\n如果您不介意的话，工作结束后……您意下如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5a566d46441963178e76d12e8c280df01e89751ad22aeb8bad962cdeddb86f3a", "ja": "そうだな。それなら一緒に歩かせてもらおうかな。\nゆっくり月を見る機会もないし。", "zh": "嗯……那就一起走走吧。毕竟也没什么机会能悠闲地赏月。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "af23ad42f5c67216fe8da323a1bd16ce95cbfa81e3d8d078ee1dae4e57ce332b", "ja": "ありがとうございます。今宵の月を見逃すのは、\nあまりにも、もったいないと思ったものですから。", "zh": "多谢您。因为妾身觉得若是错过了今宵之月，\n实在未免太过可惜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "5255bcfd2e5d5b634df0aad722fa71a3ba22ae1e8d37731dbe3aa4a5b03e5439", "ja": "……それとあなた様。\nもう一つだけよろしいでしょうか？", "zh": "……还有，贵方。\n我能再多说一件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6b1c5a3b9ce25cbf2756a5381a5b86eea49744d8a29d2897bcc35bfc4e2a40a3", "ja": "ん？　なんだ？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "dc124de3c81751d3cfefc37637210a9da3c9c4df59aa394fa043a3cf113eb2ad", "ja": "その、本日は熟考の上、選んだ服を着て参りました。\nできれば、なにか一言いただけると……。", "zh": "那个，今天我是经过深思熟虑后，穿着挑选好的衣服来的。\n可以的话，希望您能说点什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1013_p", "source_sha256": "773ee58c0de40a1efd9b8ae2b99e6f62dedeabc14223aed62190074183f94e00", "ja": "そうだったのか。言われてみれば、\n普段とは違う雰囲気で、なんだか新鮮だな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。经你这么一说，确实感觉和平时不一样，真是让人觉得很新鲜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e19e02840d972fbc55057028beddc1ae5693c58c3778055031d82dcf9308a1e9", "ja": "品の良さはそのままで、貴音によく似合ってる。\nあと気づくのが遅くなって、ごめんな。", "zh": "高雅的气质不减分毫，非常适合贵音。\n还有，我察觉得太晚了，抱歉啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "e552033d94422d6ad02ecdb02cd9eaa77af1e2ddcc1927565858c7cc92f740a6", "ja": "いえ、ありがとうございます。あなた様ならば、\nきっと褒めてくださるだろうと思っておりました。", "zh": "不，谢谢您。我本就觉得，\n若是您的话，一定会夸奖我的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "cd562a564e092ccefc2ab8346486467266efd8d7f042f5d8a63f40727b92feee", "ja": "こうして面と向かって褒められるのは、\n少し面映ゆくもありますが……。", "zh": "像这样面对面地被夸奖，虽然也让我有些不好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1017_p", "source_sha256": "84257ac2cb0eb05eb16828358aa7ef2b21da2a1f440455a1df5073dd7fc868c6", "ja": "わざわざオシャレをして迎えに来てくれたんだ。\n褒め言葉くらいじゃ物足りないと思うけど。", "zh": "你特意打扮了一番来接我，\n我觉得光是夸奖两句还远远不够呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "6b1f3eaf5f32dab61b231622d94588a6410b5e6f1d46c2eba71019f221dbfc40", "ja": "そんなことはありません。日頃からお世話に\nなっていますから、これはそのお返しのようなもの。", "zh": "没这回事。平日里一直承蒙您的照顾，这不过是聊表谢意而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "523ae01e0fe780415d04408abd2990f9e6ff811f4b70efa30520388a702f3e9f", "ja": "少しばかりの散策であっても、あなた様の心が\n安らぐのならば、私もとても嬉しく思います。", "zh": "哪怕只是短暂的散步，只要能让您的心绪\n平静下来，我也一样会感到十分欣喜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0444_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3f481971d1f1e8fc14162f78f860ffb153bed4e0ecd3765924d5b22ca34512e9", "ja": "（その後、貴音と少しの間、散策をした。\n息抜きもできたし、残りの仕事に取り掛かるか！）", "zh": "（之后，我和贵音散了一会儿步。也放松了一下，接下来该处理剩下的工作了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
